Boundary discipline (design doc `inference-engine-council-review-20260714.md`
§1b, `inference-engine-design-20260714.md` §4/§9): this package is our own
original control-plane IP (source-adapter layer, content-addressed blob store,
GGUF header parser, supervisor, ollama-API shim, HTTP app). It is licensed
Apache-2.0 by Agnostic Security Ltd. It does NOT vendor or embed llama.cpp
source. At runtime it supervises a separately-distributed `llama-server`
binary/process (invoked out-of-process via the injectable ProcessRunner
interface) and communicates with it over plain HTTP/loopback.

